<% layout("layouts/main") %>
<article class="container narrow prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">This is a portfolio project. The text below describes what the app does with data so you can review it.</p>
    <h2>What we store</h2>
    <p>When you sign up we store your username, email address and a salted, hashed password (we never store your password in plain text). We also store the listings, reviews, bookings and favourites you create.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a single session cookie to keep you logged in and to protect forms against forgery. We also save your light/dark theme preference in your browser's local storage. We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>Map tiles come from OpenStreetMap, place names are looked up with OpenStreetMap's Nominatim service, fonts come from Google Fonts, and uploaded images may be stored with Cloudinary.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can delete your own listings and reviews at any time and cancel your bookings from the Trips page.</p>
</article>
